Round 3 registered verdicts for Y and V; definition-only runs pair on what they answer; N reports the natural branch's own change; round3_paper stages U, N, Y for the paper

Y: Claude reader validity, context anchor scoped to the cells each prediction uses (answers whose
context differs are left out), B x D paired with the committed reader, the store/reader split on
the reader's answers. V: V1, V2 over the nine sets (two-way bootstrap), V minus G-b per writer.

